# Toons: the sound-effect library and music beds are paid for once, so they ARE committed
!assets/toons-sfx/*.mp3
!assets/toons-music/*.mp3
# Toons voice clips: paid for once too, so they are committed as well (owner, 2026-11-20)
!assets/toons-voice/*/*.mp3

